                                "sense_id": "57c9aad6-e92a-3f10-9638-ca94cdd5d5e7",
                                "text": "At the time Feng Yü-hsiang arrived in Pukow, Feng Kuo-chang had seemed to be gaining the upper hand over Tuan and his clique."
